# Changes go through a worktree subagent

Never edit, commit, or switch branches in `~/live-poker-trainer`.

For a new feature, bug fix, or any other requested code change, follow
`.cursor/skills/make-change/SKILL.md`:

1. Launch one subagent.
2. That subagent creates `.worktrees/<slug>` off `origin/main` and does the
   work there.
3. After it finishes, do not resume it.

Do not implement the change in the primary checkout.
